{"id":36830895654,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAIk0reJg","head_branch":"feat/prevent-concurrent-ou-merge_2.43","head_sha":"c396237a4139d90e28fe6b9e760a986f00739bf1","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":53273,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"fix: Prevent concurrent org unit merges [DHIS2-22193] (#25364)","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":99754741692,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAXOdiPvA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36830895654","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36830895654","created_at":"2026-10-01T07:32:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T07:44:44Z","run_started_at":"2026-10-01T07:32:16Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36830895654/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36830895654/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/99754741692","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36830895654/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36830895654/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36830895654/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: Prevent concurrent org unit merges [DHIS2-22193] (#25364)\n\n* fix: Prevent concurrent org unit merges\n\nOrg unit merges acquire a transaction scoped Postgres advisory lock\n(pg_try_advisory_xact_lock) before doing any work. As the lock lives in\nthe database it applies across all instances of a clustered deployment.\nA merge issued while another is in progress is rejected immediately with\n409 Conflict and error code E1505 so the client can retry later. The lock\nis released automatically on commit or rollback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NsHCSWL5yu6on4XTTktKhc\n\n* refactor: use a common merge lock shared by all merge types\n\nMove the advisory lock out of DefaultOrgUnitMergeService into a shared\nMergeLock component with a generic key (\"MERGELCK\"), so that the other\nmerge types (category option, data element, etc.) can adopt the same\nlock in follow-up work. Generalize the E1505 message accordingly.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted\n\n* fix: Take org unit merge lock before loading org units [DHIS2-22193]\n\nAddresses review feedback on the org unit merge lock:\n\n- Add OrgUnitMergeService.merge(OrgUnitMergeQuery), which acquires the\n  merge lock before the source and target org units are resolved, so a\n  merge never works on org units loaded before a preceding merge\n  committed. The controller now only calls this method.\n- Require an existing transaction for MergeLock.tryAcquire()\n  (Propagation.MANDATORY); without one the advisory lock is released as\n  soon as it is acquired and the merge would run unprotected.\n- Reject a concurrent merge with ConflictException(E1505), declared on\n  the endpoint so the 409 is documented in OpenAPI. The response is\n  unchanged: 409 with errorCode E1505.\n- Move E1505 under the generic merge errors and scope the MergeLock\n  Javadoc to the merge types that currently use it.\n- Test that a running merge holds the lock, that it is released after\n  commit and rollback, that the lock is taken before org units are\n  resolved, and the endpoint's 409, 403 and success responses.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted\n\n* fix: Declare dhis-service-administration test dependency [DHIS2-22193]\n\nOrganisationUnitControllerTest uses MergeLock, so declare the module\nwith test scope rather than relying on the transitive compile scope,\nwhich fails dependency analysis.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted\n\n* test: Assert 403 response of org unit merge without authority [DHIS2-22193]\n\nAssert the error message and that the source org unit is unchanged, so\nthe test has explicit assertions.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"c396237a4139d90e28fe6b9e760a986f00739bf1","tree_id":"46555e9bf5a58791528b8e48d206d920e7d7757f","timestamp":"2026-10-01T07:25:55Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core","fork":false,"private":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/{archive_format}{/ref}","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/branches{/branch}","collaborators_url":